        <activityName xml:lang="en">Borehole heat exchanger, specific heat demand 10W</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Borehole heat exchanger, specific heat demand 10W
Dataset for production of borehole heat exchanger in heating system with specific heat demand of 10W/m2 heated gross floor area;
UUID: 6b026065-c4cc-3b23-8ad9-180ea1f0e98b
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the production steps and drilling. Transport of raw materials to the site. water use for drilling.
Location: Data source from Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Technology, materials and components used for a typical borhole heat exchanger with an average length of 150m.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Some process information partly from 2007
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer informations and literature data. Data of different companies on market analysed. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6b026065-c4cc-3b23-8ad9-180ea1f0e98b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
